<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in heavy trade Friday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average fell 59.27 to 6,696.48.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 3.64 to 405.51.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell 38 cents.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 1,719 to 798.</p>
<p>Volume was 542,743,750 compared with 683,800,820 Thursday.</p>
</text>
